# Ferry timetable

The ferry runs every hour from **08:00** until **20:00**. Tickets are sold on board — cash only.

- Adults: €3
- Children: €1,50

![Ferry logo](ferry_files/logo.gif) Questions? Mail [info@example.org](mailto:info@example.org).
